{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d905de92721436f3acee876325a7e8b3a9634dc6311926d289bb728e1602bb22", "ja": "（今日は、グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\n美希の撮影テーマは『眠れない夜』だ）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志《アイグラ！！》的日子。\n美希的拍摄主题是《不眠之夜》。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "2d9a8be1eaa99e87e02c5eb3630a7c64ca6e2d74e46f320078325be732e34127", "ja": "ねえねえ。{$P$}って、\n夜眠れないことってある？", "zh": "呐呐，{$P$}先生，你有过晚上睡不着的时候吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a55eecf00aeccba89f7f726205bf45759424d1f4209363d893ab988352bb25fe", "ja": "そうだな……。\n毎日ではないけど、あるにはあるよ。", "zh": "是啊……虽然不是每天，但偶尔还是会有的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "e329f85e37d02dec2f5659a011c7d34843b281587ee64c0b54d28473f1245134", "ja": "あっ。ミキ、わかったの！\nそれって……ミキのこと考えてる時でしょ♪", "zh": "啊。美希懂了！\n那肯定……是在想美希的时候吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6cb58bbaf3c8eb119860d9e13a5ec235a34db1c0ec2c8a29e1ab027773805944", "ja": "ん？　美希のことは……最近少なくなってきたかもな。\n以前より心配することも減ってて……。", "zh": "嗯？美希的事啊……最近可能越来越少了吧。\n比起以前，也没那么让人操心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "b3ce73a5091a701e6c9bd4e8571e01f4e6e1e1c784628d14c9e8811120095470", "ja": "むー……。", "zh": "唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f5c9e45fe7b19f0f81bd3a7f230e2e5dde0c24f351a937b29b8e1bf6ce1ebaa3", "ja": "えっ、なんで！？", "zh": "咦，为什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "b43d334450f51d135cac547eb3fc6d68aee880a045093a6d3813d32e1d6287fb", "ja": "……あー。なんかミキ、急に眠くなってきちゃった～。\nあふぅ。ちょうどベッドもあるし、ね♪", "zh": "……啊～不知怎么的，美希突然变得好困哦～。\n啊呼。而且正好有张床在，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1008_p", "source_sha256": "fd873ce0d57a7626ff4794e9aaa77b9d53399fe8be63e555b65cae91afb3bbaf", "ja": "「ね♪」じゃない！　そのベッドは\n美希が寝るために用意したものじゃないんだぞ。", "zh": "什么「呢♪」啊！那张床\n可不是为了让美希睡觉才准备的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "ec49568163fd22376fd9b4f89e091cb6a8e9393247be26c49532a0436ee51a6a", "ja": "えーっ……寝心地の確認も必要だって思うな。\nだから、おやすみなさーい……。", "zh": "诶……我觉得也有必要确认一下睡起来舒不舒服。\n所以，晚安啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1010_p", "source_sha256": "32265b9d9f07dee0e68f1da702881de81cf712d8440517197aad28b9ea5cc507", "ja": "そういって、寝ようとするんじゃない！\nあーもう、どうしたら……。", "zh": "都这么说了，别想着睡觉啊！\n啊——真是的，该怎么办呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9da4473d9132a44b18933202fc608ce21b694a6067bccfb7ad8aaccdfe398065", "ja": "そうだ！　コホン……\nちゃんと仕事が終わったら、ご褒美があるのになー！", "zh": "对了！咳咳……\n只要好好完成工作，就有奖励哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "f7e866c5b0d869888ef80db2f3fde795f9586924b21521bf0d6831d79396fc67", "ja": "ご褒美……？　たとえば？", "zh": "奖励……？比如说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a06c13e8ad0d8da5b0a25ca45b584d15c508dcde41636960c28df9cb093ba4bd", "ja": "そうだな、帰りにショッピングに行く、とか……？", "zh": "比如说，回去的时候去逛逛街……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "6992cf134fc8dcfd72c184f5def1df77f5ce763bf50b6116ec964a8168cab44b", "ja": "えー、なんかテキトーなの……。\nミキ、また急に眠くなってきちゃった……。", "zh": "诶——总觉得有点随便呢……\n美希又突然开始犯困了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8fca70d36b3e60cac93d58c0aa6a0c5da65444069b0a44b1446d0af14bea66d5", "ja": "……は無しで！　えっと、スイーツの美味しい\nカフェはどうだ？　例えば、いちごババロア……。", "zh": "……别睡别睡！那个，去甜点很好吃的\n咖啡厅怎么样？比如，草莓芭芭露亚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "b521e3654a97fc083f4599e778f8fd344f7143742e330132d26a1201ddeee9fb", "ja": "いちごババロア～♪\nふ、ふーん……でも、それだけじゃ足りないの。", "zh": "草莓巴伐利亚布丁～♪\n哼、哼～……不过，光是那样可还不够哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3fd510131e5dc24f88175814a6dd8213799393497a88159d85df5a46dec5a7dc", "ja": "よし、わかった！　新しくできたおにぎり専門店にも\n行こう。前に行きたいって言ってたろ？", "zh": "好，我知道了！那再去新开的饭团专卖店吧。\n你之前不是说过想去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "14686811f843bd1b661637cfdd9cf2d06202ae5a19f71b29b29c710ff8330198", "ja": "えっ……ミキが言ったこと覚えててくれたの！？", "zh": "咦……你还记得美希说过的话呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1019_p", "source_sha256": "350fdf2c7748cde78123c0f20686585cd7bfe7f07a10370b7b6b2de57870b8ce", "ja": "ああ。機会があれば、美希と行こうと思っててね。\n美希、今回はこれで許してくれないか？", "zh": "嗯。如果有机会，我本来想和美希一起去的。\n美希，这次就原谅我，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "6d57e0eb13b0f7c48de56f1c666d95afa4f0970a883bcd071a26f789f86a3e0a", "ja": "もう、ハニーはズルいの……。\n仕方ないから、今日はそれで許してあげる。", "zh": "真是的，Honey好狡猾哦……\n没办法，今天就原谅你这一次吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0393_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "2249bb1a601b997282f8e479e243b17b714f5a37d11b1d9db375a7ca861b945d", "ja": "撮影、早くはじめよっか。ミキの大好きフルコースが\n待ってるから、パパッと終わらせちゃうね♪", "zh": "拍摄快点开始吧。因为美希最喜欢的全套大餐还在等着，咱们就赶紧结束吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
